              "default": "auto",
              "multiselect": false,
              "options": [
                "auto",
                "gpu",
                "cpu",
                "off"
              ],
              "tooltip": "auto uses spare VRAM, then RAM. cpu (RAM) is prefetched behind compute and costs little speed. off recomputes the prefix every step, which is slower but is the one way to rule the cache out."
